{"title":"Yeti Matriarch","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 62 Yeti that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 248 total, 248 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×248</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"yeti-fang\" title=\"Yeti Fang - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/b964f6987e786c9b807e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bones\" title=\"Bones - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c29e1ebe544dbfedca68.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bones</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silverhide-arms\" title=\"Silverhide Arms - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/74ad12c317066662bc3e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silverhide Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Whitecrown Caves</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 2</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-424\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/old-whitemane\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/dbeda05d1d9040bb1b64.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Old Whitemane</b><span>Lv 62</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Yeti: <a href=\"#/monster/snow-yeti\">Snow Yeti</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/yeti\">Yeti</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager\">Yeti Ravager</a> <span class=\"muted\">(60)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/46ef9a619c743829016e.svg\" alt=\"Yeti Matriarch\"></div><h3>Yeti Matriarch</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>62 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 62–62)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Yeti</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>469</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>38.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2.89</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><t